":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":72,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:21Z","updated_at":"2020-01-05T13:48:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2015-05-19T10:27:04Z","updated_at":"2015-07-19T14:34:01Z","closed_at":"2015-07-19T14:34:01Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"`glm::isfinite` from `compatibility.inl` returns `false` for `float` or `double` values that are less than or equal to 0.\n\nThe bug is in line 49:\n\n``` c++\nreturn x >= std::numeric_limits<genType>::min() && x <= std::numeric_limits<genType>::max();\n```\n\nFor floating point types with denormalization (see `std::numeric_limits::has_denorm`) `std::numeric_limits::min()` returns the smallest finite number greater than 0 that the type can represent instead of the smallest finite number overall.\n\nThe following should give the correct result for integer and floating point types:\n\n``` c++\nif (std::numeric_limits<genType>::is_integer || std::denorm_absent == std::numeric_limits<genType>::has_denorm)\n{\n    return std::numeric_limits<genType>::min() <= x && std::numeric_limits<genType>::max() >= x;\n}\nelse\n{\n    return -std::numeric_limits<genType>::max() <= x && std::numeric_limits<genType>::max() >= x;\n}\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/343/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}